comment0.text=\r\n\ Abstract\ base\ class\ defining\ the\ color\ and\ font\ properties\ for\ a\ UI\ theme.\r\n\ Concrete\ subclasses\ must\ provide\ specific\ color\ values\ and\ font\ choices.\r\n
